function qaEsc(qaV){return String(qaV==null?'':qaV).replace(/[&<>"']/g,qaC=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[qaC]));}
function qaButton(qaText,qaCall,qaKind='',qaDisabled=false,qaReason=''){return `<span class="stack" style="gap:4px;align-items:flex-start"><button type="button" class="btn ${qaKind}" onclick="${qaEsc(qaCall)}" ${qaDisabled?'disabled':''}>${qaText}</button>${qaDisabled?`<span class="small muted">${qaReason}</span>`:''}</span>`;}
